
@host = http://localhost:5324
@contentType = application/json

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 0. 健康检查
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 0.1 轻量健康检查（不连 Ollama，纯返回配置）
GET {{host}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### 0.2 深度健康检查（尝试列出 Ollama 本地模型）
GET {{host}}/api/health/deep
Accept: application/json


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 1. 非流式对话 POST /api/chat
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 1.1 最简调用：只传 message，服务端自动生成 sessionId
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "message": "你好，用一句话介绍你自己"
}

### 1.2 显式指定 sessionId（多轮对话起点）
# @name chatTurn1
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "message": "我叫小明，请记住我的名字",
  "sessionId": "demo-001"
}

### 1.3 第二轮：复用同一 sessionId，验证上下文记忆
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "message": "我叫什么名字？",
  "sessionId": "demo-001"
}

### 1.4 指定模型（覆盖 AgentOptions.ChatModel）
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "message": "用 JSON 格式输出三个水果名, 用中文输出",
  "sessionId": "demo-002",
  "model": "qwen3:4b"
}

### 1.5 空消息：应返回 400
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "message": ""
}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 2. 流式对话 POST /api/chat/stream (SSE)
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 2.1 基础流式：逐块返回 data: {...}
POST {{host}}/api/chat/stream
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: text/event-stream

{
  "message": "用三句话介绍一下上海",
  "sessionId": "stream-001"
}

### 2.2 带模型的流式
POST {{host}}/api/chat/stream
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: text/event-stream

{
  "message": "写一首四行小诗",
  "sessionId": "stream-002",
  "model": "qwen3:4b"
}

### 2.3 空消息：返回 400 + SSE 错误帧
POST {{host}}/api/chat/stream
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: text/event-stream

{
  "message": ""
}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 3. 会话管理 /api/sessions
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 3.1 列出所有活跃会话
GET {{host}}/api/sessions
Accept: application/json

### 3.2 删除指定会话
DELETE {{host}}/api/sessions/demo-001

### 3.3 删除不存在的会话：返回 404
DELETE {{host}}/api/sessions/not-exist

### 3.4 清空所有会话
DELETE {{host}}/api/sessions

### 测试 SSE 接口，设置超时为 300 秒
// @timeout 300000
POST http://localhost:5324/api/chat/stream
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "用三句话介绍一下上海",
  "sessionId": "rider-sse-test"
}

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 4. 循环对话 POST /api/chat/loop (SSE)
###   同一 session 内多轮迭代，每轮带 round/maxRounds/phase
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 4.1 基础循环：默认 3 轮，无 continuePrompt（Agent 自行延续）
# @timeout 300000
POST {{host}}/api/chat/loop
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: text/event-stream

{
  "message": "用一句话介绍杭州",
  "sessionId": "loop-001"
}

### 4.2 指定轮数 + 指定模型
# @timeout 300000
POST {{host}}/api/chat/loop
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: text/event-stream

{
  "message": "写一首关于秋天的七言绝句",
  "sessionId": "loop-002",
  "model": "qwen3:4b",
  "maxRounds": 3
}

### 4.3 带 continuePrompt 模板：{previous} 会被上一轮回答替换
# 第 1 轮写诗 → 第 2 轮点评 → 第 3 轮重写
# @timeout 300000
POST {{host}}/api/chat/loop
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: text/event-stream

{
  "message": "写一首关于秋天的七言绝句。",
  "sessionId": "loop-003",
  "continuePrompt": "请针对你刚才写的《{previous}》做一次逐句点评，然后重写一版更凝练的。",
  "maxRounds": 3
}

### 4.4 单轮循环：maxRounds=1，行为等同于普通 stream
# @timeout 300000
POST {{host}}/api/chat/loop
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: text/event-stream

{
  "message": "用一句话解释什么是递归。",
  "sessionId": "loop-004",
  "maxRounds": 1
}

### 4.5 轮数越界：maxRounds=999 → 服务端夹紧到 20
# 谨慎使用，会产生较长输出；仅用于验证 Math.Clamp 生效
# @timeout 600000
POST {{host}}/api/chat/loop
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: text/event-stream

{
  "message": "从 1 数到 3，每一轮只输出一个数字，不要多写。",
  "sessionId": "loop-005",
  "continuePrompt": "继续下一个数字。",
  "maxRounds": 999
}

### 4.6 空消息：返回 400 + SSE 错误帧
POST {{host}}/api/chat/loop
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: text/event-stream

{
  "message": "",
  "sessionId": "loop-006"
}

### 4.7 复用已有 session：验证 loop 会带上此前上下文
# 先跑 4.1 建立 loop-001 上下文，再执行本条
# @timeout 300000
POST {{host}}/api/chat/loop
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: text/event-stream

{
  "message": "把刚才你介绍杭州的内容改写成文言文，分两轮：第一轮列关键词，第二轮成篇。",
  "sessionId": "loop-001",
  "maxRounds": 2
}

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 5. 循环对话（非流式）POST /api/chat/loop/sync
###   一次返回全部轮次结果
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 5.1 基础循环：默认 3 轮
# @timeout 600000
POST {{host}}/api/chat/loop/sync
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "message": "用一句话介绍南京",
  "sessionId": "loopsync-001"
}

### 5.2 指定轮数与模型
# @timeout 600000
POST {{host}}/api/chat/loop/sync
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "message": "写一首关于春天的五言绝句",
  "sessionId": "loopsync-002",
  "model": "qwen3:4b",
  "maxRounds": 3,
  "continuePrompt": "针对你刚写的《{previous}》做逐句点评，指出意象与声律上的不足，然后据此重写一版。"
}

### 5.3 continuePrompt 模板：{previous} 替换上一轮回答
// @timeout 300000
POST {{host}}/api/chat/loop/sync
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "message": "写一首关于秋天的七言绝句。",
  "sessionId": "loopsync-003",
  "continuePrompt": "请针对你刚才写的《{previous}》做一次逐句点评，然后重写一版更凝练的。",
  "maxRounds": 3
}

### 5.4 单轮：maxRounds=1，行为等同 /api/chat
POST {{host}}/api/chat/loop/sync
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "message": "用一句话解释什么是递归。",
  "sessionId": "loopsync-004",
  "maxRounds": 1
}

### 5.5 轮数越界：maxRounds=999 → 夹紧到 20
POST {{host}}/api/chat/loop/sync
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "message": "从 1 数到 3，每一轮只输出一个数字，不要多写。",
  "sessionId": "loopsync-005",
  "continuePrompt": "继续下一个数字。",
  "maxRounds": 999
}

### 5.6 空消息：应返回 400
POST {{host}}/api/chat/loop/sync
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "message": "",
  "sessionId": "loopsync-006"
}

### 5.7 复用已有 session：验证跨端点共享上下文
# 先跑 5.1 建立 loopsync-001 的上下文，再执行本条
POST {{host}}/api/chat/loop/sync
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "message": "把刚才你介绍南京的内容改写成文言文，分两轮：第一轮列关键词，第二轮成篇。",
  "sessionId": "loopsync-001",
  "maxRounds": 2
}
